From 381d05593367b9b718d955e6cb5266b792e407c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: callan <callanf@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:23:19 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 24/38] kvcr.keep_source_recency (off by default): a pull pins
 the source's G2 blocks in place and leaves their recency alone, as vLLM's
 KVCR source read does (prepare_read, record_access=False; LRUCachePolicy
 keeps a pinned chunk's rank); plan_reserve skips pinned blocks still linked;
 unit test. Probe: per-tier store, landing and eviction counts and occupancy
 in the G2 snapshot, one line per forward pass

---
